# evidence for the D31 finding's screen-revenue and floor-binding sections.
!results/hindcast/miso-2021-2025-realized-t1h-d31/*/*/evolution_*.json
# capx D33 (2026-09-02): same one-bundle-scoped carve-out as the d27/d31 rules
