# finding's per-year entry-decision, build-zone and floor-binding sections.
!results/hindcast/miso-2021-2025-realized-t1h-d33/*/*/evolution_*.json
# capx D37 (2026-09-02): same one-bundle-scoped carve-out as the d27/d31/d33
