# are the sole committed evidence for the D37 finding's per-year position table
# (the reserve_margin -> accredited-firm identity the positions are computed
# from), its exit re-timing claim, and its floor-binding measurement; without
# them a future lane must re-solve both arms. The floor-retention sidecars are
# un-ignored for the same two bundles only: they carry the retained-unit
# identities that are the ONLY evidence the floor bound at all (6 coal units in
