# committable slim set (rule 34 [R-SHARD-PROMOTABLE] (a)'s pattern) rather than
# using `git add -f`, which the auto-mode classifier refuses.
# PROMOTED 2026-09-19 to MISO's designated keeper, so the committable SLIM set is
# tracked and the blanket ignore is REMOVED: the generic results/calibration rules
# above already hold back dispatch/, floors/, root *.parquet, unit_hourly_* and
# network_*, which is exactly the slim keeper set.
