# Kept OUT OF `main` — an unregistered bundle dir committed here is the Class-E
# parity RED rule 29(c) forbids — but NOT deleted: rule 31 protects a result
# until the owner has ruled on promotion, and `.gitignore` is what discharges
# the delete-before-merge duty. `rm` is never required.
