# nwpp42_measured_coal_hr is ARM ATTEMPT 1 and is an INVALID A/B: it diverged
# from the keeper on THREE fields (measured_coal_heat_rates None->True as
# intended, but ALSO hydro_cascade_coupling True->False and hydro_backfill_year
