# ref (verified 2026-09-19: `git ls-remote origin | grep eb526988` returns
# nothing) and will be garbage-collected. Rule 33(f)(4) requires saying that
# plainly rather than keeping a command that will fail.
# COST IF EVER WANTED: ~17 min of LP (the original leg measured 16.9 min,
# because it ran WITHOUT the cascade). DELIBERATELY NOT RESCUED, and the
# reasoning is on the record: this bundle is invalid TWICE OVER -- an invalid
# A/B (three config fields moved, not the intended one) and, since rule 36
# [R-YEAR-ISOLATION], a span solve carrying the cross-year warm start. It can
# never be registered or promoted under any reading, so rule 31 [R-RETAIN]'s
