# the per-year dirs out of `main` (rule 32 [R-SHARD] (d)) and commits only the
# composite. They stay ON LOCAL DISK, not deleted — rule 31 [R-RETAIN]: .gitignore
# discharges the delete-before-merge duty, `rm` never does.
# The composed arm, results/calibration/soco54_marginal_gas, IS committed.
#
# Recovery is by IMMUTABLE SHA (rule 33 [R-SHARD-ARCHIVE] (d)); the explicit
# `git fetch origin <sha>` FIRST is REQUIRED — the shard branches are auto-deleted
# when this lane's PR merges (rule 33(f)(1)), so these SHAs are PROVENANCE, not a
# durability claim: cost any leg recovery as a RE-SOLVE.
