# (gitignored, and a sibling of their own out-dir), so the parent regenerated it
# with `run_calibration_full.py --rebuild-benchmark <composite>` — ZERO LP, 11 s,
# and exactly one file changed (meta.json; all 34 parquet/json outputs
# byte-identical). Every arm leg's shared-input hashes are BYTE-IDENTICAL to the
# keeper's own leg for the same year, which is the A/B integrity proof.
results/calibration/soco54_arm_20[0-9][0-9]/

